                    {status === 'VALID' ? 'Access Granted' : status === 'EXPIRED' ? 'Pass Expired' : 'Invalid QR'}
                  </h3>
                  <p className="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Scanned at {new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}</p>
